    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-07T16:10:47+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-07T16:10:47+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T05:40:47Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-07T05:40:47Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system located near Tasmania maintains a ridge over the state as it moves east into the Tasman Sea. A trough ahead of a strong cold front is expected move over western SA on Thursday, and track east across the rest of SA on Friday. A ridge remains over northern SA on Saturday while a series of troughs and cold fronts move across the state early next week.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-07T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-08T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-07T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending southeast to southwesterly in the evening then tending northeast to southeasterly in the late evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-08T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-07T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Becoming cloudy. High chance of showers west of Ceduna, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening, possibly severe with damaging winds west of Ceduna. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h turning northerly 30 to 45 km/h during the morning then tending northwest to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:50am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers east of Ceduna, high chance elsewhere. A thunderstorm likely in the morning and afternoon, possibly severe with damaging winds east of Ceduna. Winds north to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h shifting west to southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning then decreasing to 20 to 30 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds northwest to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching 21 to 27.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers east of Ceduna, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northerly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning then shifting south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
